---
import { company } from "../../data/company";
import { href } from "../../i18n";

const carriers = company.carriers.join(", ").replace(/, ([^,]*)$/, " and $1");
const days = company.withdrawalDays;
const mail = company.serviceEmail;
const addr = company.address.slice(0, 2).join(", ");
---

<p><em>The Danish version of these terms applies. This translation is for information.</em></p>

<h2>1. Seller</h2>
<p>
  {company.legalName}<br />
  {company.address.map((l) => <>{l === "Danmark" ? "Denmark" : l}<br /></>)}
  CVR: {company.cvr} · VAT no.: {company.vat}<br />
  Email: <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a> · Phone: <a href={company.phoneHref}>{company.phone}</a><br />
  Supervisory authority for herbal products for smoking: the Danish Business Authority (Erhvervsstyrelsen)
</p>

<h2>2. Age limit</h2>
<p>We only sell to people aged 18 or over. Your age is checked with MitID before a purchase can be completed. The carrier may ask for ID on delivery. If we are in doubt about your age, we cancel the order and refund the amount.</p>

<h2>3. Prices</h2>
<p>All prices are in Danish kroner (DKK) including 25% VAT. Shipping is added and shown in the cart before you pay. We reserve the right to correct obvious pricing errors.</p>

<h2>4. Ordering and payment</h2>
<p>You order by adding items to the cart, entering your details, completing the age check and pressing "Order with obligation to pay". You can correct input errors in the cart until you press the button. The contract is concluded in Danish.</p>
<p>We accept VISA and Mastercard. You are only charged when the order ships. You receive an order confirmation by email with these terms, and we store the contract.</p>

<h2 id="levering">5. Delivery</h2>
<p>We only deliver to addresses in Denmark. Your parcel is sent with {carriers}. Delivery usually takes {company.deliveryDays} business days. The shipping price depends on weight and carrier and is shown before you pay.</p>

<h2 id="reklamation">6. Complaints about defects</h2>
<p>The defect rules of the Danish Sale of Goods Act apply. You can complain for 2 years from delivery. If an item is defective, you can choose repair or replacement unless that is impossible or disproportionately costly for us; otherwise you can get a price reduction or cancel the purchase if the defect is not minor. If the item is repaired, the complaint period is extended once by 12 months.</p>
<p>Tell us within a reasonable time after you discover the defect. For valid complaints we cover reasonable return shipping costs. Return address: {company.legalName}, {addr}.</p>

<h2>7. Right to cancel</h2>
<p>You have a {days}-day right to cancel from the day you receive the item. You cancel by using the <a href={href("en", "withdraw")}>Cancel your purchase</a> page, by sending the standard cancellation form below, or by sending a clear message to <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>. After cancelling, return the item within {days} days.</p>
<p>Items are delivered in sealed packaging. For health and hygiene reasons the right to cancel lapses for an item if its seal is broken after delivery (Danish Consumer Contracts Act § 18(2)(5)). Unopened items can always be returned within the period.</p>
<p>You pay the direct cost of returning the item. You are only liable for any loss in value caused by handling beyond what is needed to establish the nature and characteristics of the item.</p>

<h3 id="formular">Standard cancellation form</h3>
<p>To {company.legalName}, {addr}, {mail}:</p>
<p>
  I hereby give notice that I cancel my contract for the sale of the following goods: ____<br />
  Ordered on ____ / received on ____<br />
  Name of consumer: ____<br />
  Address of consumer: ____<br />
  Date and signature (only if this form is sent on paper): ____
</p>

<h2>8. Refunds</h2>
<p>If you cancel, we refund all payments, including standard shipping, without undue delay and no later than 14 days after receiving your notice, using the same payment method. We may wait to refund until we have received the item or proof that it has been sent.</p>

<h2>9. Personal data</h2>
<p>Read how we process your data in our <a href={href("en", "privacy")}>privacy policy</a>.</p>

<h2>10. Complaints</h2>
<p>If you have a complaint, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>. If we cannot find a solution, you can complain to the Centre for Complaint Resolution, Nævnenes Hus, Toldboden 2, 8800 Viborg, via <a href="https://naevneneshus.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">naevneneshus.dk</a>.</p>
<p>The contract is governed by Danish law.</p>
